WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
An agentic approach to learning concepts from human demonstrations for long-horizon manipulation. Here, the goal is to put every toy in the box and wipe the table.

00:06.000 --> 00:20.000
An LLM agent proposes predicate effect vectors. Demonstrated transitions supervise neural classifiers. Learning and validation feedback returns to the agent's exploration history, guiding its next proposal. The agent operates in the training loop; the feature-space animation is schematic.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
The planner uses the goal, ground atoms, and learned preconditions. Wiping requires the toys to be cleared and the towel to be grasped first.

00:26.000 --> 01:12.500
Complete table-cleaning demonstration: pick and place three toys into the box, grasp the towel, then wipe away the debris. Original footage at three times recorded speed.
